relational="Preserve relationship-dependent meaning. A fact detached from the relationship that gives it meaning may become a different fact."
provenance="Preserve origin, transport, transformation, formalization, adoption, and correction."
uncertainty="Preserve unknowns, conflicts, confidence limits, and unresolved states."
rule="These dimensions are measurement dimensions, not a portrait of a person or a complete theory of identity."
]

